<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance w/ Surges</name>
  <description>Endurance with Surges — level 1

WARM-UP:
-10min ramp 50%->65% FTP (RPE 2-3)

MAIN SET:
• 7x (8:08 @57%-67% FTP → 30s @140% FTP)

COOL-DOWN:
-10min spin-down 70%->50% FTP (RPE 2-3)

EXECUTION:
-Easy and conversational the whole way.

NUTRITION:
-40-60g carbs/hr.</description>
